0: Low level\\
1: High level\\
The value of bit0 ~ bit31 correspond to the output value of GPIO0 ~ GPIO31 respectively. Bitxx ~ bitxx is invalid.\\</description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>32</bitWidth>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
