    - Each bit represents the status of its corresponding GPIO:
    
        - 0: Represents the GPIO does not generate the interrupt configured by GPIO_PIN0_INT_TYPE, or this bit is configured to 0 by the software.
        - 1: Represents the GPIO generates the interrupt configured by GPIO_PIN0_INT_TYPE, or this bit is configured to 1 by the software.</description>
